From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheShermanTanker <tanksherman27@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Aug 2023 16:12:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Initial Support for using gcc to compile a Windows JDK

From the Windows/gcc port in https://github.com/TheShermanTanker/jdk,
branch experimental, commit 777c26e8, rebased onto jdk-27+35. Conflicts resolved
in favour of jdk-27's Visual Studio settings; -lpsapi added where jdk-27
added psapi.lib. The GNU as rewrite of libjsvml is left out.

Upstream: JEP draft 8288293 (https://openjdk.org/jeps/8288293), not merged
